
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
@categoryId = 1
@menuId = 1
@orderId = 1
@email = buyer@example.com
@date = 2026-11-03

### A01 카테고리 목록 → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}categories
Content-Type: application/json

### A02 카테고리 상세 → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### A03 카테고리 등록 → 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "예시카테고리"
}

### A04 카테고리 수정 → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "싱글오리진수정"
}

### A05 카테고리 삭제 → 204, 빈 본문
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/2
Content-Type: application/json

### A15 카테고리별 메뉴 → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}/menus


### A03 오류: 카테고리명 중복 → 409 CATEGORY_NAME_DUPLICATED
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "싱글오리진"
}
